    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Twist the rules of blackjack by playing custom cards from your hand. Each card in your hand shows a range of possible values (like 1\u20135). When played, its true value is revealed and added to your total. Get as close to 21 as possible without going over. Win the hand and deal some damage!\u00a0</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810010/extras/fc6d7e51e17f65d839e09b30ee7323eb.poster.avif?t=1753540162\" width=754 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810010/extras/fc6d7e51e17f65d839e09b30ee7323eb.webm?t=1753540162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810010/extras/fc6d7e51e17f65d839e09b30ee7323eb.mp4?t=1753540162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose the cards you play wisely! Some cards will increase your strength to deal more damage or gain shield to absorb hits. </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810010/extras/7dd2b0e90b9d7d2891cb474c6956be41.poster.avif?t=1753540162\" width=606 height=158 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810010/extras/7dd2b0e90b9d7d2891cb474c6956be41.webm?t=1753540162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810010/extras/7dd2b0e90b9d7d2891cb474c6956be41.mp4?t=1753540162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Purchase cards with unique abilities to gain an advantage against the dealers.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810010/extras/f73ef9d957081356f04f636709169f15.poster.avif?t=1753540162\" width=786 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810010/extras/f73ef9d957081356f04f636709169f15.webm?t=1753540162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810010/extras/f73ef9d957081356f04f636709169f15.mp4?t=1753540162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your card's suits and possible values while building a powerful deck! Each run the cards possible values and suits are randomized to make each run feel different!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5+ hours of gameplay &amp; loads of replay ability\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ playing cards and permanent  abilities (DNA)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Achievements\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Leaderboards\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
